  "warnings": [
    "The Incoterm doesn't fit the other terms: it reads 'DAP Lagos warehouse' (the supplier's own country / port of loading), but the final destination is 'Kampala, Uganda' and the schedule says 'Freight and insurance | included'. Confirm with the supplier whether they mean DAP Kampala.",
